  "description": "Si-Won and Beom-Woo had been friends since childhood. Therefore, the news that Si-Won had suddenly left to study abroad without a word deeply hurt Beom-Woo. Six years later, a familiar voice sharply pierced Beom-Woo, who had been living a dissolute life... \n\n*\"Are you a slut?\"*\n\nAs if to prove that much had changed in their relationship.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
